罪名明白，當坐之。漢家有正法，王犯纖介小罪過，即行法直斷耳，安能寬王。」驚動以文法。王意益下，心恐。公戶滿意習於經術，最後見王，稱引古今通義，國家大禮，文章爾雅。謂王曰：「古者天子必內有異姓大夫，所以正骨肉也；外有同姓大夫，所以正異族也。周公輔成王，誅其兩弟，故治。武帝在時，尚能寬王。今昭帝始立，年幼，富於春秋，未臨政，委任大臣。古者誅罰不阿親戚，故天下治。方今大臣輔政，奉法直行，無敢所阿，恐不能寬王。王可自謹，無自令身死國滅，為天下笑。」於是燕王旦乃恐懼服罪，叩頭謝過。大臣欲和合骨肉，難傷之以法。","source_term":"昭帝實武帝子狀"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji060-011","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"oro_evn_khk"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003665"]},{"id":"r7z_ane_tmt_A","label":"武帝（外戚世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"武帝","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0034","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0062","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0106","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0189","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0016","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0057","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0077","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0093","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0116","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0227","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m035-0348","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m037-0117","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m039-0000","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m040-0024","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m042-0015","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m042-0028","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m043-0026","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0025","c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0216"]},{"surface":"其男","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m022-0147"]},{"surface":"太子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m023-0004"]},{"surface":"男","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m018-0181"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","quote":"武帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0062","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","quote":"武帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","quote":"武帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0189","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","quote":"武帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m028-0016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-