:p026","text":"會昭帝崩，宣帝初立，緣恩行義，以本始元年中，裂漢地，盡以封廣陵王胥四子：一子為朝陽侯；一子為平曲侯；一子為南利侯；最愛少子弘，立以為高密王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"昭帝","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_D","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xkc_rp5_a3d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"廣陵王胥","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"四子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"朝陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"平曲侯","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"南利侯","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"高密王","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CD","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","book_id":"b-shiji-060","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p030","text":"會武帝崩，昭帝初立，旦果作怨而望大臣。自以長子當立，與齊王子劉澤等謀為叛逆，出言曰：「我安得弟在者！今立者乃大將軍子也。」欲發兵。事發覺，當誅。昭帝緣恩寬忍，抑案不揚。公卿使大臣請，遣宗正與太中大夫公戶滿意、御史二人，偕往使燕，風喻之。到燕，各異日，更見責王。宗正者，主宗室諸劉屬籍，先見王，為列陳道昭帝實武帝子狀。侍御史乃復見王，責之以正法，問：「王欲發兵罪名明白，當坐之。漢家有正法，王犯纖介小罪過，即行法直斷耳，安能寬王。」驚動以文法。王意益下，心恐。公戶滿意習於經術，最後見王，稱引古今通義，國家大禮，文章爾雅。謂王曰：「古者天子必內有異姓大夫，所以正骨肉也；外有同姓大夫，所以正異族也。周公輔成王，誅其兩弟，故治。武帝在時，尚能寬王。今昭帝始立，年幼，富於春秋，未臨政，委任大臣。古者誅罰不阿親戚，故天下治。方今大臣輔政，奉法直行，無敢所阿，恐不能寬王。王可自謹，無自令身死國滅，為天下笑。」於是燕王旦乃恐懼服罪，叩頭謝過。大臣欲和合骨肉，難傷之以法。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"昭帝","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_D","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"旦","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"齊王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"先帝或劉澤所屬齊王未具名；不沿用當朝武帝或燕王旦，不據子字補其他人物姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"劉澤","kind":"person","person_id":"7zq_926_dnw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0054","start":54,"end":58,"surface":"大將軍子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"昭帝","kind":"person","person_id":"oro_evn_khk_D","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"宗正","kind":"person","person_id":"pca_046_m1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m030-0099","start":99,"end":103,"surface":"公戶滿意","kind":"person","person_id":"6p